00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.779
So we're going to go step by step
building up our proteins starting

00:00:19.779 --> 00:00:21.439
from the amino acid sequence.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:25.650
Then going through all the individual
intermolecular forces for how the

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.700
structure can be organized, help
stabilize itself, and then eventually

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.860
we'll go into all the kinds of different
