want to look beyond just the order that

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:12.130
these individual things are bound in.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:13.920
How can that change?

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:17.740
Um, especially as the structure continues
to grow and get bigger and bigger.

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:21.450
So now the most important feature
is when the chain starts growing,

00:06:21.539 --> 00:06:23.610
being that it has a geometry to it.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:26.839
So there's tetrahedral and
there's trigonal pyramidal and

00:06:26.839 --> 00:06:30.599
trigonal planar geometries that
are being seen in the structure.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:31.840
What's going to happen?

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:35.780
It's going to start folding and bending
now, and especially because this

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:37.970
molecule is getting very large, right?

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:43.090
If you talk in 10, 20, 30, 100, hundreds
