00:06:56.030 --> 00:06:58.760
Well, eventually you're, how are you
going to be carrying, if you wanted

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:03.080
to carry the whole pile, it's going
to lead to this giant clump of sheets.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:07.330
Well, it's kind of sort of a similar idea
of whether that's a good analogy or not.

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:09.589
It's, it's following the same thing.

00:07:09.979 --> 00:07:13.150
So what's going to happen
is the secondary structure.

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:18.770
So the next level of organization
is as this thing folds, it can

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:20.719
